## Technical Details

The fix involved minimal changes to maintain the existing game mechanics while correcting the initialization:

```typescript
// Before
const [complexityLevel, setComplexityLevel] = useState(1); // Stage 2
const [stageCompletionTimes, setStageCompletionTimes] = useState<number[]>(() => {
